     "html": "<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #000000;\">Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">Thank you for downloading our <a href=\"https://f.hubspotusercontent30.net/hubfs/4087538/Download%20Offers/Private%20Label%20Supplements%20Guide/DaVinci-Laboratories-Private-Label-Guide.pdf\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">Definitive Guide to Private Labeling Supplements</a>!</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">Inside, you'll find everything you need to know about successfully launching your private label brand. Additionally, even though our process is streamlined and simple, you can view our <a href=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/DaVinci-ClientOnboarding_v3.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\">onboarding guide here.</a> It will help you stay ahead of the cuve while launching a private label brand for your practice.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
